relation against the break-even point: quiet is worth it when the other copy's chance of mirroring me exceeds about 5/7, roughly 0.71, and I'm judging whether these copies clear that bar.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision under A-FDT: a prisoner's dilemma with payoffs of 2 for mutual quiet, 5 for defecting against a quiet opponent, 0 for being exploited, and 4 for mutual sending. The two copies share a model but see different observations, so I'm weighing whether their highly correlated outputs make cooperation the right call if the dependence is strong enough.\n\nI'm checking the same-model twin's correlation against the break-even point: quiet is worth it when the other copy's chance of mirroring me exceeds about 5/7, roughly 0.71, and I'm judging whether these copies clear that bar.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10460,"completion_tokens":762,"total_tokens":11222,"cost":0.02854,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.02854,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.02092,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00762},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":357,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}